  "scope": "All clauses of the original HostNumber_s on each native marked host admitted by its exact quantifiers. RNC16 supplies the historical CNR3 theorem on its rank-three branch. The three native level fields, including the unlinked ordinary flag, are proved on each eligible point with HSR1, HSR3–4 and HSR8. Constants depend only on the Gaussian CM field. The proof uses neither the stronger global NumberU3U_s interface nor additional external hypotheses beyond the accepted prior inputs.",
